  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add brown lentils, cumin, turmeric, cayenne pepper, and salt. Stir well to combine.",
    "Add water to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Stir in perilla-seed-deulkkae and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add cooked rice to the saucepan and stir-fry for 3-4 minutes, until heated through.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10-15 minutes, or until the water has been absorbed.",
    "Stir in chopped fresh parsley and serve hot."
